          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">the latte stone, now a national symbol; seafaring and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/outrigger-canoe">outrigger canoes</a>; weaving and pottery; the matrilineal clan; the creation story of Puntan and Fu’una; the value of inafa’maolek, “doing good for each other”; red <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rice">rice</a> and kelaguen</span></div>
